    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Raimund's acting all shifty...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What is it he can't tell me right now? Something that has to wait until after dark?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I don't get it, but whatever. He can do his own thing.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(It's already so late, I'm only now bringing the food over... Seniora Lemuen must be starving by now. And, these portions are tiny.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_hungry"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Be patient, stomach! Stop growling already! Didn't you eat just a minute ago?!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(*sigh*...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I really hope I can feast one day, just eat all I want without worry.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-Who's there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you're here! Who are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's hiding over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if you keep quiet, I, I already saw you! You aren't from the abbey!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bullet_loading",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Come out! If, if you don't, I'm gonna call the others over\u2013 ...I mean, I'm gonna pull the trigger!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright. I'm coming out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, guess I messed up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "You sure have sharp eyes. Was it the light from my wings? I knew it, it's way too easy to pick out a Sankta, what with everyone having different wings and halos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good grief. And here I was thinking I wouldn't need to be all that sneaky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never seen you before. Who are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, Seniora. Let's put the gun down first. That isn't something a nice girl should be pointing at her own kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a Sankta too. You can feel I don't have anything against you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am, uhh... I guess you can call me a justicebringer this time? Yeah, something like that, since I'm here to save people and all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, if you don't want to talk, I'm going to call for help\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "50,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "action": "shake",
        "power": 10,
        "times": 50,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Woah woah, settle down there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "action": "shake",
        "power": 10,
        "times": 50,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmmmph!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Let go of me!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, but you'd better not scream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "200,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*gasp*... *gasp*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, didn't do a good job controlling my strength there. Are you alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*... *cough, cough*... Who exactly are you, and what are you after?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's nothing I can't tell you. I'm looking for someone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Another Sankta, just like me. Pink hair, probably still in a wheelchair. She's got a kind and gentle look to her, but her personality is actually anything but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Is she talking about Lemuen?!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? That look on your face tells me... you know who I'm talking about? My lucky day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The food you just brought over\u2013 who's it for? I've got a feeling you're taking it to Lemuen, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Ack?!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "(How did she know??)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, looks like I'm right on the money again? You really need to work on your poker face!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, would you mind telling me how Seniora Lemuen has been doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd prefer not to say, huh? Or are you not allowed to? You're hesitating, and a bit scared...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "S-Stop it! Stop making things up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I making things up? I guess you'd know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "You seem to have a lot on your mind, which feels a little odd. How could a cloistered place like this have so much trouble?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where is all that coming from? Are you getting into fights because there aren't many of your own kind here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's none of your business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't it? Are you saying that because the patron firearm you're holding hasn't been maintained in a while, because it's rusting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't mind helping you out with that. I'm pretty good at gun repair, so why don't we do a little trade? You just tell me where Lemuen is. That's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not tell me? I bet you already have an idea of who I am, right? You look pretty smart to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Laterano send you too, like Seniora Lemuen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's enough small talk now. I'm a bit short on time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're really not gonna tell me where Lemuen is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*... Well, if that's how it is, that's how it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "150,0",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_glassclink",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "150,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me take care of delivering that food for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*gasp*...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's that, then. Vale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
